{"id":"e06t1","name":"Service Log Health","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","input_dir"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>Several services write their logs to <code>input_dir</code>, one folder per service and per day:</p>\n<pre class=\"exv\">input_dir/\n  &lt;service&gt;/\n    &lt;YYYY&gt;/&lt;MM&gt;/&lt;DD&gt;/\n      &lt;anything&gt;.log</pre>\n<p>A valid log line looks like <code>2026-03-01T10:15:02Z [ERROR] payment failed (latency=120ms)</code>: a UTC timestamp, a level between brackets (<code>INFO</code>, <code>WARN</code> or <code>ERROR</code>), a message, and optionally a latency at the end of the line. Lines that do not start with a timestamp and a level (for example stack traces) are ignored. The service is the first folder of the path.</p>\n<p>Your task is to return, for every service and hour that has at least one valid line, the columns <code>service</code> (string), <code>hour</code> (timestamp, the start of the hour), <code>lines</code> (long, the number of valid lines), <code>errors</code> (long, lines with level <code>ERROR</code>) and <code>avg_latency_ms</code> (double, average latency of the lines that have one, rounded to 1 decimal, <code>null</code> if none), sorted by <code>service</code>, then <code>hour</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/payments/2026/03/01/a.log</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">2026-03-01T10:15:02Z [ERROR] payment failed (latency=120ms)\n  at Gateway.call(Gateway.java:42)\n2026-03-01T10:40:00Z [INFO] ok (latency=80ms)\n2026-03-01T11:01:00Z [WARN] slow call\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/payments/2026/03/01/b.log</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">2026-03-01T10:59:59Z [INFO] retry ok\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/search/2026/03/01/x.log</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">2026-03-01T10:00:00Z [DEBUG] noise\n2026-03-01T10:05:00Z [ERROR] index missing (latency=1000ms)\nERROR without timestamp\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/search/2026/03/01/x.log.gz.txt</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">2026-03-01T10:06:00Z [ERROR] should be ignored\n</pre><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>service</th><th>hour</th><th>lines</th><th>errors</th><th>avg_latency_ms</th></tr><tr><td>payments</td><td>2026-03-01 10:00:00</td><td>3</td><td>1</td><td>100.0</td></tr><tr><td>payments</td><td>2026-03-01 11:00:00</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>null</td></tr><tr><td>search</td><td>2026-03-01 10:00:00</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1000.0</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"import os\nfrom pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, input_dir: str) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return spark.read.text(input_dir)\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["dossiers imbriqués","regexp_extract","date_trunc heure","moyenne avec NULL"],"minutes":20,"source":"Kata Lab","files":{"root":"input_dir","files":{"payments/2026/03/01/a.log":"2026-03-01T10:15:02Z [ERROR] payment failed (latency=120ms)\n  at Gateway.call(Gateway.java:42)\n2026-03-01T10:40:00Z [INFO] ok (latency=80ms)\n2026-03-01T11:01:00Z [WARN] slow call\n","payments/2026/03/01/b.log":"2026-03-01T10:59:59Z [INFO] retry ok\n","search/2026/03/01/x.log":"2026-03-01T10:00:00Z [DEBUG] noise\n2026-03-01T10:05:00Z [ERROR] index missing (latency=1000ms)\nERROR without timestamp\n","search/2026/03/01/x.log.gz.txt":"2026-03-01T10:06:00Z [ERROR] should be ignored\n"}},"visible":[{"input":{"input_dir":{"__dir__":{"payments/2026/03/01/a.log":"2026-03-01T10:15:02Z [ERROR] payment failed (latency=120ms)\n  at Gateway.call(Gateway.java:42)\n2026-03-01T10:40:00Z [INFO] ok (latency=80ms)\n2026-03-01T11:01:00Z [WARN] slow call\n","payments/2026/03/01/b.log":"2026-03-01T10:59:59Z [INFO] retry ok\n","search/2026/03/01/x.log":"2026-03-01T10:00:00Z [DEBUG] noise\n2026-03-01T10:05:00Z [ERROR] index missing (latency=1000ms)\nERROR without timestamp\n","search/2026/03/01/x.log.gz.txt":"2026-03-01T10:06:00Z [ERROR] should be ignored\n"}}},"expected":{"columns":["service","hour","lines","errors","avg_latency_ms"],"rows":[["payments","2026-03-01 10:00:00",3,1,100.0],["payments","2026-03-01 11:00:00",1,0,null],["search","2026-03-01 10:00:00",1,1,1000.0]]}},{"input":{"input_dir":{"__dir__":{"auth/2026/12/31/z.log":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z [INFO] bye (latency=5ms)\n2027-01-01T00:00:00Z [INFO] hello (latency=6ms)\n2027-01-01T00:10:00Z [INFO] latency=99ms in text\n"}}},"expected":{"columns":["service","hour","lines","errors","avg_latency_ms"],"rows":[["auth","2026-12-31 23:00:00",1,0,5.0],["auth","2027-01-01 00:00:00",2,0,6.0]]}}],"hidden_n":6,"hidden":"","solution":""}